# rustbench73.config: rust.config plus the kernel release 7.3.1-rustbench, for the display lane's bench kernel next to
# the 7.3.1 default and next to the kernel lane's own 7.3.1-rust (rustbench.config): /boot/h713-kernel-rustbench73.fit
# and /lib/modules/7.3.1-rustbench, one-shot selector boot_rustbench73 (docs/kernel-rust.md). Developer fragment:
# KERNEL_CONFIG=rustbench73 build.sh kernel, never an image.
CONFIG_RUST=y
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-rustbench"
